# MadGraph5 batch script: e+ e- > e+ e- (Bhabha) at LO
#
# Why this exact process:
#   - s⊕t-channel interference with IDENTICAL initial/final flavors: the
#     sharpest regression for crossed-line conjugation and the relative sign
#     between crossed diagram classes (research/notes/12, fix 5).
#   - Colorless, massless externals => no new evaluator features needed.
#
# launch with lpp=0 fixed-energy beams; the default run_card lepton pT cut
# regulates the t-channel divergence for the (informational) cross section.
generate e+ e- > e+ e-
output ee_to_ee -nojpeg
launch
set lpp1 0
set lpp2 0
set ebeam1 250
set ebeam2 250
set use_syst False
done
